    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905150/extras/c4eaa0f81f5a6d5beab92e0748c7d33f.poster.avif?t=1719189555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905150/extras/c4eaa0f81f5a6d5beab92e0748c7d33f.webm?t=1719189555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905150/extras/c4eaa0f81f5a6d5beab92e0748c7d33f.mp4?t=1719189555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description:</h2>Welcome to Manacircle. This game is a combat adventure game about exploring the deep unknown and solving the problem in a way.<br><br><br>Our heroine &quot;Clair&quot; is trying to find the representative of Costoria with her new mysterious partner &quot;Player&quot;.<br><br>But when she takes a step into the deep unknown. new faces and new troubles on the way and she needs to solve the problem in a way that only she can do.<br><br>The journey to find the true meaning of Manacircle has begun!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The world is formed with colorful retro style pixel art design and classic 8-bit music.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique and Interesting Battle system.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique and lovely characters and strong enemies!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Comedic, action-packed and touching story!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go on an adventure! Test your skills! Find items and make yourself stronger!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905150/extras/17486ce3951673ae165959ee26d307b4.avif?t=1719189555\" /></div><br>W,A,S,D = Movement<br>Q = Back / Parry(combat)<br>Space = Interact / Attack(combat)<br>E = Inventory<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905150/extras/9260bf8f310110e6cdd2b8e9a1904545.poster.avif?t=1719189555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905150/extras/9260bf8f310110e6cdd2b8e9a1904545.webm?t=1719189555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>((Warning : Game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or similar condition, careful.))",
